部家当去景德镇做陶瓷的白日梦想家。\"\n      },\n      \"S2\": {\n        \"prompt_audio\": \"example/audios/male_mandarin.wav\",\n        \"prompt_text\": \"呃，还有一个就是要跟大家纠正一点，就是我们在看电影的时候，尤其是游戏玩家，看电影的时候，在看到那个到西北那边的这个陕北民谣，嗯，这个可能在想，哎，是不是他是受到了黑神话的启发？\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"text\": [\n      [\"S1\", \"哈喽，AI时代的冲浪先锋们！欢迎收听《AI生活进行时》。啊，一个充满了未来感，然后，还有一点点，<|laughter|>神经质的播客节目，我是主持人小希。\"],\n      [\"S2\", \"哎，大家好呀！我是能唠，爱唠，天天都想唠的唠嗑！\"],\n      [\"S1\", \"最近活得特别赛博朋克哈！以前老是觉得AI是科幻片儿里的，<|sigh|> 现在，现在连我妈都用AI写广场舞文案了。\"],\n      [\"S2\", \"这个例子很生动啊。是的，特别是生成式AI哈，感觉都要炸了！ 诶，那我们今天就聊聊AI是怎么走进我们的生活的哈！\"]\n    ]\n  }"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 8, "type": "Text", "title": "Json格式示例", "properties": {"cnr_id": "kaytool", "ver": "88d4ad5e270287cba566f1744097d718722eeaa3", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "SOULX_MODEL", "links": [24, 38], "label": "SOULX_MODEL", "type": "SOULX_MODEL", "localized_name": "SOULX_MODEL"}], "size": [300, 154], "pos": [212.90174865722656, 1479.048095703125], "widgets_values": ["SoulX-Podcast-1.7B", "hf", false, 667893215, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "llm_engine"}, "name": "llm_engine", "label": "llm_engine", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "llm_engine"}, {"widget": {"name": "fp16_flow"}, "name": "fp16_flow", "label": "fp16_flow", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "fp16_flow"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "SoulXPodcastLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SoulXPodcastLoader"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [35], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", 