p_p 搭配使用\"\n - info=\"Ras窗口：↑增强跨词连贯、减少停顿；过大可能失控\"\n - info=\"Ras阈值：↓更连贯更快，↑更克制防重复。逐字读可降至 0.10~0.12\""], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [525.0966796875, 371.0878601074219], "pos": [1067.2066650390625, 1991.7779541015625], "id": 17, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "PODCAST_INPUT", "links": [39], "label": "PODCAST_INPUT", "type": "PODCAST_INPUT", "localized_name": "PODCAST_INPUT"}], "size": [420, 440], "pos": [590, 1580], "widgets_values": ["simple", "[S1] OK, so the question I've been asking everybody to start with is how did you get into magic?\n[S2] So, this is phenomenal, actually. I have a fun little tidbit, just recently. Isn't a few days ago, I got a little pop up on my Facebook, um, in my Facebook memories, if that makes sense. Where it actually reminded me of the exact day, literally the exact day that I learned how to play Magic. And it was 9 years ago, and I learned how to play Magic. I'm from Southern California. I had just moved to San Diego, and I didn't know anyone. I knew like four people in the entire city.", "{}"], "inputs": [{"name": "soulx_model", "link": 24, "label": "soulx_model", "type": "SOULX_MODEL", "localized_name": "soulx_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "S1_prompt_audio", "link": 44, "label": "S1_prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "S1_prompt_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "S2_prompt_audio", "link": 35, "label": "S2_prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "S2_prompt_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "input_mode"}, "name": "input_mode", "label": "input_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "input_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "dialogue_script"}, "shape": 7, "name": "dialogue_script", "link": 43, "label": "dialogue_script", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "dialogue_script"}, {"widget": {"name": "json_config"}, "shape": 7, "name": "json_config", "label": "json_config", "type": "STRING", "locali